msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: OpenPINN 0.2.0\n"
"Language: en\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "配置器教程"
msgstr "Configurator tutorial"

msgid "这页用同一个 :doc:`method_configurator` 走完 PINN 与算子两条路径。配置器在浏览器中 设计问题并生成 Python；它不会训练、不会读取所填路径的文件，也不会上传 CSV。 下载 ``.py`` 后，训练和产物写入都发生在本地 Python 环境。"
msgstr "This page walks through both the PINN and Operator paths in the same :doc:`method_configurator`. The configurator designs the problem and generates Python in the browser; it does not train, read files from entered paths, or upload CSV data. After downloading the ``.py`` file, training and artifact creation happen in your local Python environment."

msgid "开始前"
msgstr "Before you start"

msgid "按 :doc:`install` 在仓库根目录安装 ``python -m pip install -e \".[test,docs]\"``。"
msgstr "Follow :doc:`install` and run ``python -m pip install -e \".[test,docs]\"`` from the repository root."

msgid "打开 :doc:`method_configurator`。先选 solution path，再从上到下完成问题与训练设置。"
msgstr "Open :doc:`method_configurator`. Select a solution path, then complete the problem and training settings from top to bottom."

msgid "页面预览用于核对几何、PDE 和边界语义；最终以下载脚本中的对象和参数为准。"
msgstr "Use the preview to verify geometry, PDE, and boundary semantics; the objects and parameters in the downloaded script are authoritative."

msgid "PINN：几何 → PDE → 边界 → 方法"
msgstr "PINN: geometry → PDE → boundaries → method"

msgid "选择 **PINN** 路径。选一维区间或二维几何；二维可使用矩形、圆孔、图片/DXF 识别后的轮廓等已有入口。"
msgstr "Select the **PINN** path. Choose a 1D interval or 2D geometry; 2D options include rectangles, circular holes, and contours recognized from images or DXF files."

msgid "在控制方程设计器选择模板或自由组合项，核对 PDE 公式和变量维度。"
msgstr "Choose a template or compose terms in the governing-equation designer, then verify the PDE formula and variable dimensions."

msgid "逐侧设置 Dirichlet、Neumann 或 Robin 条件；预览中的边名、方向和数值应与表单一致。"
msgstr "Set Dirichlet, Neumann, or Robin conditions on each side; names, directions, and values in the preview should match the form."

msgid "选择方法、训练步数、采样数和网络参数。短步数只适合链路检查。"
msgstr "Choose the method, training steps, sample counts, and network parameters. A short run is only suitable for a workflow check."

msgid "点击“下载 .py”，在仓库根目录执行 ``python 下载的文件.py``。"
msgstr "Click “Download .py” and run ``python downloaded_file.py`` from the repository root."

msgid "PINN 配置器中几何、PDE 和逐边边界预览示意"
msgstr "Geometry, PDE, and per-edge boundary preview in the PINN configurator"

msgid "PINN 路径示意：先核对几何与边编号，再核对 PDE，最后检查逐边条件。"
msgstr "PINN path: verify geometry and edge numbers, then the PDE, and finally each edge condition."

msgid "脚本运行后会打印结果目录。常见产物包括 ``metrics.json``、``history.csv``、 ``predictions.npz``、``loss.svg`` 和 ``result.svg``；具体解释见 :doc:`user_guide_results`。完整的瞬态与二维 Poisson 案例见 :doc:`code_tutorials` 中的 Burgers 与 PINN 2D Poisson notebooks。"
msgstr "The script prints its result directory. Common artifacts include ``metrics.json``, ``history.csv``, ``predictions.npz``, ``loss.svg``, and ``result.svg``; see :doc:`user_guide_results` for details. Complete transient and 2D Poisson examples are the Burgers and PINN 2D Poisson notebooks in :doc:`code_tutorials`."

msgid "Operator：模型 × training_mode"
msgstr "Operator: model × training_mode"

msgid "选择 **Operator** 路径，再选模型 DeepONet 或 FNO，以及 ``data_only``、 ``physics_only`` 或 ``hybrid``。不要把已弃用的 PINO shim 当作第三个模型。"
msgstr "Select the **Operator** path, then choose DeepONet or FNO and ``data_only``, ``physics_only``, or ``hybrid``. Do not treat the deprecated PINO shim as a third model."

msgid "使用同页问题设计器定义自定义一维/二维 PDE 与边界。DeepONet 走坐标自动微分， FNO 在规则网格上使用网格导数。"
msgstr "Use the problem designer on the same page to define a custom 1D/2D PDE and boundaries. DeepONet uses coordinate autodiff; FNO uses grid derivatives on a regular grid."

msgid "根据模式配置数据："
msgstr "Configure data according to the mode:"

msgid "**训练观测 CSV** 只为优化提供监督项。``data_only`` 与 ``hybrid`` 必填； ``physics_only`` 隐藏该入口，也不会静默借用参考数据。"
msgstr "The **training-observation CSV** supplies only the supervised optimization term. It is required for ``data_only`` and ``hybrid``; ``physics_only`` hides it and never silently borrows reference data."

msgid "**训后参考 CSV** 只用于训练后的指标比较，三种模式都可选。"
msgstr "The **post-training reference CSV** is used only for metric comparison after training and is optional in all three modes."

msgid "两套开关、路径、列映射和尺度完全独立。页面只把本地路径写入脚本，绝不上传文件。"
msgstr "Their switches, paths, column mappings, and scales are independent. The page only writes local paths into the script and never uploads files."

msgid "下载 ``.py`` 并在仓库根目录运行。非法的模型、模式、PDE 或数据组合会在复制/下载前 明确报错，不会换成另一条路径。"
msgstr "Download the ``.py`` file and run it from the repository root. Invalid model, mode, PDE, or data combinations produce a clear error before copy/download and never switch to another path."

msgid "Operator 配置器中模型训练模式、二维 Poisson PDE 边界和 CSV 角色示意"
msgstr "Model training mode, 2D Poisson PDE boundaries, and CSV roles in the Operator configurator"

msgid "Operator 路径示意：模型与模式决定训练目标，PDE/BC 定义物理，观测与参考数据不混用。"
msgstr "Operator path: the model and mode determine the training objective, PDE/BC define the physics, and observation and reference data remain separate."

msgid "与代码教程对应"
msgstr "Relation to the code tutorials"

msgid ":doc:`code_tutorials` 的主算子案例使用 **FNO × physics_only** 训练二维 Poisson，因此 不提供观测 CSV；notebook 中的解析解仅做预测对照。若切换到 ``hybrid``，必须另行提供 训练观测，参考 CSV 仍保持可选。配置器仍是下载独立 ``.py`` 的入口，notebook 则适合 逐单元查看物理设置、损失和预测图。"
msgstr "The primary Operator example in :doc:`code_tutorials` trains 2D Poisson with **FNO × physics_only**, so it supplies no observation CSV; the notebook's analytic solution is only a prediction reference. Switching to ``hybrid`` requires separate training observations, while the reference CSV remains optional. Use the configurator to download a standalone ``.py`` file and the notebook to inspect physics settings, loss, and prediction plots cell by cell."
